sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User
  participant View as Vue Component
  participant Store as Pinia/Reactive Store (store.ts)
  participant Server as Backend API (/api/v1/...)
  participant DB as SQLite Database

  User->>View: Click "Delete Skill" or "Update Agent"
  View->>Store: deleteSkill(skillId) / updateAgent(agentId, data)
  Store->>Store: Capture local state snapshot (clone array / object)
  Store->>Store: Optimistic UI mutation (e.g. filter array or update fields)
  
  Store->>Server: HTTP PATCH / DELETE / POST
  
  alt Authoritative Server Success (200 / 201)
    Server->>DB: Commit changes to SQLite
    DB-->>Server: OK
    Server-->>Store: 200 OK (Authoritative state / ID confirmation)
    Store->>View: Mutation confirmed, UI remains updated
  else Server / Network Failure (4xx, 5xx, or Network Error)
    Server-->>Store: 400 / 500 Error { message: "Validation or constraint failed" }
    Store->>Store: ROLLBACK: Restore previous snapshot into reactive state
    Store->>Store: Set state.errorMessage = "Failed to update: ..."
    Store-->>View: Throw or surface actionable error notification
    View-->>User: Display Toast / Banner: "Failed to persist changes. Restored previous state."
  end
